{"version":1,"content":"<p>「百億富三代」鍾培生與老婆莊雅婷（Angel）結婚未夠半年，於今年7月喜迎千金，升呢做新手父母，兩人愛得甜蜜，鍾培生日前於社交網展現愛妻號風範，大晒晚上11點炒飯給莊雅婷食的片，表示：「老婆肚餓，11點幾話想食炒飯，整個XO醬鮑魚五香肉丁蛋</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T10:16:31.581424+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T10:01:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T10:09:39.125602+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T10:09:39.125602+00:00","content_hash":"81d28bef603e455bc704d1ab1b481deb77732209306e354c3cd619bcd8a2e31b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}